 num("$\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{n}$","2",0.001,"Geométrica con $a=1$ y $r=1/2$. La suma es $\\dfrac{a}{1-r}=2$."),
